{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/BVDecide/Normalize.html#Lean.Meta.Tactic.BVDecide.Normalize.bvNormalize\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">BVDecide</span>.<span class=\"name\">Normalize</span>.<span class=\"name\">bvNormalize</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hyps?</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/BVDecide/Normalize/Hyp.html#Lean.Meta.Tactic.BVDecide.Normalize.Hyp\">Hyp</a>)</span></span> := <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option.none\">none</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/BVDecide/Normalize/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.Tactic.BVDecide.Normalize.PreProcessM\">PreProcessM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/BVDecide/Normalize.html#Lean.Meta.Tactic.BVDecide.Normalize.bvNormalize","kind":"def","line":127,"name":"Lean.Meta.Tactic.BVDecide.Normalize.bvNormalize","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/BVDecide/Normalize.lean#L127-L185"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/BVDecide/Normalize.html#Lean.Meta.Tactic.BVDecide.Normalize.normalizeEprQuantifiers\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">BVDecide</span>.<span class=\"name\">Normalize</span>.<span class=\"name\">normalizeEprQuantifiers</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/BVDecide/Normalize/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.Tactic.BVDecide.Normalize.PreProcessM\">PreProcessM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Unit\">Unit</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"We run rewriting on the EPR quantifiers once ahead of time so we do not re-normalize them during\nMBQI over and over again. However, in order to ease later processing we do not just normalize them\nfully but instead keep the guards as separate implications, i.e. go from\n```\n∀ (x₁ ... xₙ), guard x₁ → ... → guard xₙ → body x₁ ... xₙ\n```\nto\n```\n∀ (x₁ ... xₙ), normalized_guard x₁ = true → ... → normalized_guard xₙ = true → normalized_body x₁ ... xₙ = true\n```\nThis is done as during instantiation we can always simplify away all guard conditions trivially.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/BVDecide/Normalize.html#Lean.Meta.Tactic.BVDecide.Normalize.normalizeEprQuantifiers","kind":"def","line":72,"name":"Lean.Meta.Tactic.BVDecide.Normalize.normalizeEprQuantifiers","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/BVDecide/Normalize.lean#L72-L124"}}],"imports":["Lean.Meta.Sym.AbstractS","Lean.Meta.Sym.Grind","Lean.Meta.Sym.Intro","Lean.Meta.Sym.Util","Lean.Meta.Tactic.BVDecide.EPR.Pass","Lean.Meta.Tactic.BVDecide.Normalize.AC","Lean.Meta.Tactic.BVDecide.Normalize.AndFlatten","Lean.Meta.Tactic.BVDecide.Normalize.ApplyControlFlow","Lean.Meta.Tactic.BVDecide.Normalize.Basic","Lean.Meta.Tactic.BVDecide.Normalize.CollectHyps","Lean.Meta.Tactic.BVDecide.Normalize.EmbeddedConstraint","Lean.Meta.Tactic.BVDecide.Normalize.Enums","Lean.Meta.Tactic.BVDecide.Normalize.IntToBitVec","Lean.Meta.Tactic.BVDecide.Normalize.Reduction","Lean.Meta.Tactic.BVDecide.Normalize.Rewrite","Lean.Meta.Tactic.BVDecide.Normalize.ShortCircuit","Lean.Meta.Tactic.BVDecide.Normalize.Simproc","Lean.Meta.Tactic.BVDecide.Normalize.Structures","Lean.Meta.Tactic.BVDecide.Normalize.TypeAnalysis","Lean.Meta.Tactic.Grind.BVDecide.Types"],"instances":[],"name":"Lean.Meta.Tactic.BVDecide.Normalize"}